{% set names = ref('issue_tree.branches[*].name') %}
For each branch below, check that "disproven_if" names a concrete, observable
result that would actually contradict the hypothesis (not a vague "if the
market is bad").

{% for t in ref('branch') %}{% set name = names[loop.index0] %}
## {{ name }}
{{ t | tojson(indent=2) }}
{% endfor %}

Pass only if all three branches are falsifiable.
Reply with only valid JSON: {"results": "pass"} or {"results": "fail"}.
